sequenceDiagram
    participant CI as CI/CD Pipeline
    participant CLI as model-extractor CLI
    participant Config as Config Loader<br/>.env file
    participant Registry as OCI Registry<br/>registry.redhat.io<br/>HTTPS/443
    participant HF as HuggingFace API<br/>huggingface.co<br/>HTTPS/443
    participant GitHub as GitHub API<br/>api.github.com<br/>HTTPS/443
    participant FS as Filesystem<br/>Output Directory
    participant Report as metadata-report CLI

    Note over CI,Report: Flow 1: Model Extraction Pipeline

    CI->>CLI: Execute model-extractor<br/>--models-index, --output-dir
    CLI->>Config: Load .env file<br/>HF_TOKEN, GITHUB_TOKEN
    Config-->>CLI: Environment variables

    CLI->>CLI: Parse models index YAML

    loop For each model (parallel, max-concurrent=5)
        CLI->>Registry: Fetch OCI manifest<br/>GET /v2/.../manifests/...
        Registry-->>CLI: Container manifest
        CLI->>Registry: Fetch model card layer<br/>GET /v2/.../blobs/...
        Registry-->>CLI: tar/gzip layer
        CLI->>CLI: Extract & parse model card<br/>from Markdown
        CLI->>FS: Write metadata.yaml
    end

    Note over CI,Report: Flow 2: HuggingFace Enrichment

    CLI->>HF: GET /api/collections<br/>RedHatAI collections<br/>Auth: Bearer HF_TOKEN
    HF-->>CLI: Collection data

    loop For each model
        CLI->>HF: GET /api/models/{model}<br/>Auth: Bearer HF_TOKEN
        HF-->>CLI: Model details, tags,<br/>license, README
        CLI->>FS: Update metadata.yaml<br/>with enriched data
    end

    Note over CI,Report: Flow 3: OCI Artifact Enrichment

    loop For each model
        CLI->>Registry: Fetch config blob<br/>architecture, timestamps
        Registry-->>CLI: Config blob data
        CLI->>FS: Update metadata.yaml<br/>with OCI artifact info
    end

    Note over CI,Report: Flow 4: Catalog Generation

    CLI->>FS: Read all metadata.yaml files
    CLI->>FS: Read static catalog YAML
    CLI->>CLI: Merge, deduplicate,<br/>consolidate models
    CLI->>FS: Write models-catalog.yaml

    Note over CI,Report: Flow 5: MCP Server Catalog

    CLI->>FS: Read MCP servers index YAML
    CLI->>Registry: Fetch OCI architecture data
    Registry-->>CLI: Architecture metadata
    CLI->>FS: Write MCP servers catalog YAML

    Note over CI,Report: Flow 6: Agent Catalog

    CLI->>FS: Read agents index YAML
    loop For each agent
        CLI->>GitHub: GET repos/.../agent.yaml<br/>Auth: Bearer GITHUB_TOKEN
        GitHub-->>CLI: agent.yaml
        CLI->>GitHub: GET repos/.../README.md<br/>Auth: Bearer GITHUB_TOKEN
        GitHub-->>CLI: README.md
    end
    CLI->>FS: Write agents catalog YAML

    Note over CI,Report: Flow 7: Reporting

    CI->>Report: Execute metadata-report<br/>--catalog, --output
    Report->>FS: Read models-catalog.yaml
    Report->>FS: Read extraction output
    Report->>Report: Calculate completeness
    Report->>FS: Write reports<br/>Markdown + YAML
